sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser (Angular)
  participant G as API gateway
  participant R as Redis
  participant S as Service
  participant DB as Service database
  B->>G: HTTPS request + Bearer access token
  G->>G: add X-Correlation-Id if missing
  G->>R: rate-limit counter for this user or IP
  alt over the limit
    G-->>B: 429 Too Many Requests (ApiError)
  end
  G->>G: verify RS256 signature with cached JWKS, check expiry
  alt token missing or invalid on a protected path
    G-->>B: 401 Unauthorized (ApiError)
  end
  G->>S: forward request + correlation id
  S->>S: check role, MFA claim and ownership
  S->>DB: read or write (one transaction, outbox row if a fact changed)
  DB-->>S: result
  S-->>G: JSON response
  G-->>B: response with X-Correlation-Id
